The [[Tusk Piercer]] is a [[Ranger]] [[Weapon]] normally obtained by combining a [[Bow and Arrow]] with a [[Walrus Tusk]]. It deals more damage than the [[Bow and Arrow]] and has a somewhat different ability, gaining {{icon/spikes}} at the start of battle, but it subsequently spends {{icon/spikes}} on {{icon/star}} weapon hit to increase the damage of its next attack.

In a long fight, the [[Tusk Piercer]] could actually net '''cost''' the player {{icon/spikes}}, so this should be kept in mind for {{icon/spikes}} builds. Still, it can do respectable moderate damage, with the elevated starting {{icon/spikes}} dealing some extra damage in the early part of the fight.

The [[Tusk Piercer]] probably is not the best [[Bow and Arrow]] upgrade, but it's definitely the easiest to craft, and this has its advantages when looking for a quick power boost, in time for the next fight. It's something to use the [[Walrus Tusk]] on, at the very least, which really doesn't do much on its own.
